WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
The most mentioned dog food brand was never

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.020
ranked first.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.040
In RecoScope's November 20th snapshot, Hill's Science Diet

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.800
appeared in 11 of 12 usable answers.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.080
Purina Pro Plan appeared in 10.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.820
But all four comparative answers ranked Purina Pro Plan

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.680
first, Hill's second, and Royal Canin third.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.540
We captured ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Perplexity across

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.080
three prompt types using the same dog owner

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:26.580
profile.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.000
In the under $70 per bag answers, Purina

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.460
ONE appeared in all four.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.520
Mentions don't verify delivered prices, bag sizes, or

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.200
suitability for a particular dog.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.420
On November 14th, Hill's appeared in 8 of

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.260
12 answers.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.560
Today, 11.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.200
The comparative top three stayed the same.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.340
These are dated snapshots, not a controlled trend.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.880
Track how often a brand appears and where

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.740
it ranks separately.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:55.720
These findings describe captured answers, not product quality.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.740
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
